The arguments should be NULL, as below, for everything though or you will get a different error message. This is like you had in your first post, but just a comment to make sure OLS, linprob, prop and N are set to NULL.

p_sumstats <-sumstats(files,ref,trait.names,se.logit,info.filter,maf.filter,OLS=NULL,linprob=NULL,prop=NULL,N=NULL)

